        {
          "text": "Part in hand, you reach Mrs. Pell's generator. It rattles. Then it giggles."
        },
        {
          "who": "dee",
          "text": "Generators shouldn't giggle."
        },
        {
          "who": "rook",
          "text": "Mrs. Pell? Quick question. Did you know you have a gremlin?"
        },
        {
          "who": "gremlin",
          "text": "This is MY generator. I've lived here rent-free since 1987."
        },
        {
          "who": "dee",
          "text": "Boss, I made you something. The Wrench of Science. Picture it, then hit him with it."
        },
        {
          "who": "gremlin",
          "text": "Wrench? WRENCH?!"
        }
      ]
    }
